  "description": "IXICIC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H76 N4 O4 Yb4,2(C4 H8 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 2 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 3 O neighbors; Yb1A (Yb) has 2 O neighbors; Yb2A (Yb) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.282-4.112 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.33-151.33°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H92N4O6Yb4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
